    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "P. Marry & Associates presents to the market this extended three bedroom town house located in a prim location with this mature development. Within a stones throw from the North beach, located next to the Secondary school and backing on to the GAA pitches, this property which has been brought to the market in very good condition throughout is sure to attract numerous potential buyers looking for their ideal home. \r\n\r\nVIEWING IS HIGHLY RECOMMENDED"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "P. Marry & Associates presents to the market this extended three bedroom town house located in a prim location with this mature development. Within a stones throw from the North beach, located next to the Secondary school and backing on to the GAA pitches, this property which has been brought to the market in very good condition throughout is sure to attract numerous potential buyers looking for their ideal home. \r\n\r\nVIEWING IS HIGHLY RECOMMENDED\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance hall: (4.11m X 1.78m) Wood floor, dado rail, recessed lights, soak alarm, Guest W.C. & W.H.B. with tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLiving room: (7.41m X 4.13m) Feature fireplace, recessed lights, wood floor, T.V. point, access to extension (bathroom).\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bathroom:  (2.23m X 1.74m) Shower unit with electric shower fitted,  W.C., W.H.B., Tiled floors, Tiled walls, sky light.\r\n\r\nKitchen: (4.59m X 3.67m) Wall & floor mounted units, part tiled walls, wood floor, plumbed for washing machine.\r\nBack hall: with wood floor and access to south facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nLanding:     Hot press, access to attic\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: (3.45m X 3.08m) Built-in wardrobes, not overlooked at rear.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  (3.19m X 3.85m) Built-in wardrobes, T.V. point, \r\n \r\nBedroom 3: (2.78m X 2.09m)\r\n\t\r\nMain Bathroom:  (2.45m X 1.73m) W.C., W.H.B. with vanity unit, Double shower, tiled floor, tiled walls.\r\n\r\nGARDENS: \r\nFRONT: On street parking\r\nREAR: South facing, outside tap, not overlooked"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
